  "shortDescription": "Set availability, share a secure booking link, and manage appointments from one workspace.",
  "description": "Bookins helps African service businesses configure services, set weekly availability, share secure public booking links, manage appointments, and keep contact history together. Guest access is limited to release-pinned booking actions and never exposes the owner workspace.",
