  "version": "0.3.0",
  "releaseType": "minor",
  "releaseNotes": "Refresh the Bookins owner workspace and public booking flow with clearer setup guidance, faster navigation, an in-memory local sample workspace, African currency options, responsive booking screens, and a complete Store media set. No new permissions or data stores.",
